infographic relation-dagre-flow-lr-compact-card
data
  title How evidence reaches a decision
  desc Arrows show information flow, not causal proof
  nodes
    - id research
      label User research
      desc Understand needs.
    - id metrics
      label Product metrics
      desc Observe behavior.
    - id analysis
      label Analysis
      desc Connect the evidence.
    - id review
      label Independent review
      desc Challenge assumptions.
    - id decision
      label Decision
      desc Choose the next action.
  relations
    - from research
      to analysis
    - from metrics
      to analysis
    - from analysis
      to decision
    - from review
      to decision
theme
  colorBg #F8F5F3
  colorPrimary #537A93
  palette #3F6655 #537A93 #A66F45 #865F7F
  base
    text
      font-family sans-serif
